            {
               "text": "<p class=\"desc\"><img id=\"imgMath12\" onclick=\"htImageZoom('imgMath12', '0%')\" src=\"\" class=\"imgcenter\"/><b>Figure 1</b>: Geographic coordinates locate a point on the sphere; the arrows show the three directions r, θ and φ at a point on its surface. © Mapswire (<htcite0>)</p>",
               "source": [
                  {
