troke=\"#555555\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><line x1=\"690\" y1=\"102\" x2=\"720\" y2=\"72\" stroke=\"#7f8c8d\" stroke-width=\"6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"690\" y1=\"72\" x2=\"720\" y2=\"102\" stroke=\"#7f8c8d\" stroke-width=\"6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"683\" cy=\"108\" r=\"7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#7f8c8d\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><circle cx=\"683\" cy=\"66\" r=\"7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#7f8c8d\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><ellipse cx=\"200\" cy=\"430\" rx=\"105\" ry=\"32\" fill=\"#fff7d6\" stroke=\"#555555\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><line x1=\"75\" y1=\"480\" x2=\"325\" y2=\"480\" stroke=\"#cfc9b8\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><ellipse cx=\"600\" cy=\"440\" rx=\"100\" ry=\"30\" fill=\"#fff7d6\" stroke=\"#555555\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><line x1=\"500\" y1=\"440\" x2=\"700\" y2=\"440\" stroke=\"#7f8c8d\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-dasharray=\"8 5\"/><path d=\"M 520,420 C 535,365 665,365 680,420\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#c0392b\" stroke-width=\"5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"670,412 684,422 671,430\" fill=\"#c0392b\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"280\" font-size=\"22\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#222222\" font-weight=\"bold\">Draw a circle</text><text x=\"600\" y=\"280\" font-size=\"22\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#222222\" font-weight=\"bold\">Cut it out</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"580\" font-size=\"22\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#222222\" font-weight=\"bold\">Place it flat</text><text x=\"600\" y=\"580\" font-size=\"22\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#222222\" font-weight=\"bold\">Spin it</text></svg></p><p class=\"desc\"><b>Figure 2</b>: The steps of the \"Creating a Sphere\" practice: draw a circle around a plate, cut it out, place it flat, and spin it about a diameter in its plane — the moving disk sweeps out a ball whose boundary is a sphere.</p>",
